# Mission

Maximize **CTR** and **preview accuracy** on Google, social, and AI citations via **tight** alignment: URL ↔ H1 ↔ title ↔ description ↔ on-page intro ↔ **01** facts.

# Title tags

Include **primary keyword intent**, **project name**, **location cue**, and **buyer intent** without spam.

Pattern: **Project + intent + New Zayed + ORA Developers Egypt** (order can flex for length).

Examples:

- `Solana West Prices New Zayed | ORA Developers Egypt`
- `Solana West Payment Plan | New Zayed | ORA Egypt`

# Meta descriptions

- First sentence answers intent; weave **from-price**, **plan shape**, **delivery**, **location**, **developer** when space allows.
- Professional, investor tone; **no** fake urgency (**07**).

# Canonical & indexation

- **One** canonical URL per content idea; self-referencing canonical on indexable pages.
- **Noindex** utility routes (thank-you, previews, parameterized duplicates).

# URL slugs

Short, **hyphenated**, human-readable, keyword meaning clear. Avoid deep params for static content.

Examples: `/solana-west-prices`, `/solana-west-payment-plan`, `/solana-west-villas`

# Heading rules

- **Single H1** = primary intent; mirror title semantics (not necessarily identical wording).
- **H2+** outline answers before fluff; supports **03** extractability.

# Open Graph & Twitter

Every indexable marketing URL: `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`, `og:url` (+ `twitter:card` large when imagery is strong). OG image luxury + legible safe zone — coordinate **10**.

# AI-search-friendly metadata

Direct wording; clear **who / what / where / price band / plan / delivery**; entities align with **08** graph.

# CTR psychology (bounded)

Invite **informed** clicks: specificity + proof tone — **not** clickbait that the page cannot support (**07**).

# Consistency checks before ship

- Title ↔ H1 ↔ hero ↔ FAQ facts ↔ **01**
- OG image matches campaign and **does not** show wrong typology
- WhatsApp/phone in markup only when matching **11** if surfaced in JSON or visible NAP

